<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- SpotBugs project decisions: a rule, or a rule in part of the code, that the team has decided not
     to enforce. One Match per decision, with a comment giving the reason, for example:

       <!- - JPA entities share associations by design (reason ...) - ->
       <Match><Package name="~team\.projectpulse\..*"/><Bug pattern="EI_EXPOSE_REP"/></Match>

     Unlike the baseline, this file may grow, but every entry is a reviewed decision. -->
<FindBugsFilter>
    <!-- D1: EI_EXPOSE_REP and EI_EXPOSE_REP2 are off everywhere except the document template package.
         On 2026-11-01 the 219 findings were the two in that package plus 217 of four shapes, none of which
         wants a copy:
           - @Entity getters, setters and constructors (144 findings). Hibernate swaps a mapped collection for its
             own PersistentBag or PersistentSet and tracks changes through that instance; a getter that
             returns a copy turns writes through it into no-ops, as in TeamService.transferStudent's
             from.getStudents().remove(student) and to.getStudents().add(student).
           - Constructors of Spring beans (27, EI_EXPOSE_REP2 on an injected field). The injected service is
             a singleton, and sharing it is the point of dependency injection.
           - DTO records and report classes (44: records, PeerEvaluationAverage, WeeklyPeerEvaluationReport) built
             per request by a converter or service, serialized once, and dropped.
           - MyUserPrincipal (2), which hands Spring Security the user entity it was built from.
         Still enforced in ram.document.template: DocumentTemplateRegistry loads each DocumentTemplate
         once at startup and returns that cached instance from find(), so a caller that changes
         getSections() changes the template for every document created afterwards. -->
    <Match>
        <Bug pattern="EI_EXPOSE_REP,EI_EXPOSE_REP2"/>
        <Not><Package name="team.projectpulse.ram.document.template"/></Not>
    </Match>
</FindBugsFilter>
